= 双栏排版

栏宽由版心宽度减去栏间距后平均分配。断行、两端对齐、悬挂标点都按当前栏宽计算，
因此每一栏的右边界都能对齐。

中文与英文混排时，CJK 字符之间产生可伸缩但自然宽度为零的 glue，两端对齐仍然生效；
行首禁则与行末禁则保证标点不会出现在错误的位置。

== 断词

Typography is the art and technique of arranging type to make written language
legible, readable, and appealing when displayed. The arrangement of type involves
selecting typefaces, modifying point size or line spacing, adjusting letter-spacing,
and tweaking word-spacing, as well as applying optimum line lengths.

Hyphenation follows the Knuth–Liang pattern matching algorithm, so long words such
as typography, hyphenation, and characteristic are broken at the strongest pattern
positions rather than arbitrarily.

%% pagebreak

== 跨栏流动

内容按栏顺序流动，填满一栏后进入下一栏；一页内所有栏填满才翻页。表格、代码块和
图片按当前栏宽排版。

%% columnbreak

`%% columnbreak` 立即结束当前栏，从下一栏继续；栏底的脚注放不下时整组顺延到下一栏。

:: code text
---
columnWidth() = (contentWidth() - (columns - 1) * column_gap) / columns
colX(i)       = margins.left + i * (columnWidth() + column_gap)
---
